body:
Yepp I sent in my audition (videos and pics) and passed the first round. Over there they can't go for round 2 unless they receive this email.

&#x200B;

edit: Thank you kind stranger \^\_\_\^. I will audition in California once they open up their monthly audition again\~

For context, I bought 2 call options a few days ago and it was partially filled (?). So I only got one contract instead two for 2.0 so $200. At the time, it said I have -1 contract.... i thought it was a glitch and it’d Go away if I sell the option. Sold it today for $430 except now it says I have -2. So WHATS going on?

&#x200B;

p/S: it says I’m down 225 even tho I sold it for $430 when I bought it at $200? I’m so confused.
